## Summary
Walmart is set to accept Apple Pay and Google Pay as payment options at select Walmart and Sam's Club stores, with plans to roll out these tap-to-pay methods to all locations by the end of the year. This expansion enhances digital payment choices for customers at the retailer.

## Key Points
- Walmart will introduce Apple Pay and Google Pay at select stores.
- The rollout begins with specific Walmart and Sam's Club locations.
- Full expansion to all stores is planned by the end of the year.
- This move supports tap-to-pay technology adoption in retail.


